  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 13th level, the rockstar can chose to deal high average damage (4 + 1/2 rockstar level) for his rock-out attack rather than rolling the dice (typically 1d6 + 1/2 rockstar level). Additionally, at 15th level, the rockstar can do this with his solo ability (8<sup>*</sup> + 1/2 rockstar level). He always has the option to chose to roll his damage if he wishes, but once the dice has been rolled, he may not use this ability until the start of his next turn.</p>\n<p><sup>* This number is modified by the rockstar’s power solo class feature.</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/the-rockstar#toc29\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
